{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-14T08:27:21.700Z","data":{"text":"The task is complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Implemented the unified change page layout** (web-inspection \"Change page layout\" / \"Change page hand-off\"):\n\n- **`ChangeView.tsx`** — rewrote around the required order: head (`p.page-label`, `h2#change-view-title`, `p.page-summary`), error alert, opened hand-off, top block, folds, then `div.page-buttons`. Props unchanged; holds `handoffOpen` for the plan-button toggle; keeps `ChangeActionsPanel` after the bar with today's props.\n- **`PageBlock.tsx`** (new) — one top block per state, reusing `NoticePanel` and `HandoffBlock` and the page-model functions (`progressLine`, `haltFacts`, `landLine`, `landedLine`).\n- **`PageFolds.tsx`** (new) — the closed fold sequence Brief, Plan, Land, `Tasks · <k> of <n> done` (task table in `div.table-scroll`), Approval digest, About this change, reusing the existing panels unchanged.\n- **`HandoffBlock.tsx`** (new) — `section.handoff`, `pre.handoff-text`, no-prompt line, `Copy hand-off`, plus `copyText`.\n- **`page.css`** (new) — 44px minimums, wrapping, scrolled table, bottom-sticky button bar at narrow widths; imported in `main.tsx`.\n- **`tests/ui-change-page.test.tsx`** (new) — proves all seven listed scenarios.\n\n**Verification:** task verify passes (17/17), `pnpm verify` passes (typechecks, build, all tests, lint), and the existing `ui-change`, `ui-land`, `ui-runs-after`, `ui-notices`, `ui-review`, and `ui-actions` tests pass unchanged — no assertion changes were needed. Result written to `openspec/changes/192-change-page-phone/.run/results/3.md`."}}
